{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/touring-exhibition/54","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Four Painters of the Stieglitz Circle","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","id":"actor/1","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Four Painters of the Stieglitz Circle documents the kinds of works that were made between 1907 and 1925 by the four artists to whom he devoted most of his promotional efforts. As such, it demonstrates the kind of imagery that prompted Stieglitz's new thinking about the nature and significance of American art.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"Activity"}